# Present so BOTH Dockerfile variants get a fair shake: without it, `COPY . .`
# drags the host's node_modules (built for the host's OS/arch) into the image,
# which inflates the result for a reason that has nothing to do with the
# approach being compared. Rigging the naive variant to look worse than it
# really is would make the whole benchmark worthless.
node_modules
.svelte-kit
build
.pokkum
pokkum.lock
